        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/edgy/mission_fox/scene_fox_contractcreation.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 9b1893a4-5ad2-4cd9-8666-4e7579c52ecc).Image",
        "Description": "The files were very helpful, we found a lot of Providence Operatives, but there was something that caught my attention, a person by the name of Rolf Hirschmuller. I searched the ICA database and found that he is owns a club in Berlin, Germany, but in the shadows he is actually a Drug Lord knows as &quot;Vein&quot;. The nicknames comes from the most popular drug he sells, one of the  effect is dissolving the veins. Eliminate Mr. Hirschmuller and his 2 bodyguards and retrieve a phonebook that Rolf has.",
